<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs031" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>An operating loop as a native cycle under a working title: stages that feed back into the first, each with an icon, a short title and one line, labels kept short.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="PrXzfVbZTg"><h2>How the plan is run, quarter after quarter</h2><smart-layout cell-size="20" variant="cycle"><smart-layout-item><icon source="image.pictographic.icon" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/p2KcT3AQIMR4CVEFqTvT.svg?stroke=45" class="accessory-image"></icon><div><h4>Plan</h4><p>Regional managers set the quarter's targets.</p></div></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><icon source="image.pictographic.icon" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/lsO5exJlLkx9pFEz0fHP.svg?stroke=45" class="accessory-image"></icon><div><h4>Deliver</h4><p>Operations runs the fixed routes.</p></div></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><icon source="image.pictographic.icon" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/KIdrxTxiXT727djleEWu.svg?stroke=45" class="accessory-image"></icon><div><h4>Review</h4><p>Finance checks results against plan each month.</p></div></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><icon source="image.pictographic.icon" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/Uxk3R2Epg1UH03Jsm1Dv.svg?stroke=45" class="accessory-image"></icon><div><h4>Adjust</h4><p>Schedules and stock move before the next quarter.</p></div></smart-layout-item></smart-layout></grid-item></grid></section>